\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n  \n\nwhere ${x}^{T}({A}^{T}A)x$ is the quadratic form with the matrix ${A}^{T}A.$ \n\nThe maximum value of this quadratic form, when $‖x‖=1,$ is equal to the largest eigenvalue of the matrix ${A}^{T}A.$\n\nSince the largest eigenvalue of ${A}^{T}A$ is $9,$ we obtain\n\n$$\n{max}_{‖x‖=1}{‖Ax{‖}^{2}}=9\\,⟹\\,{max}_{‖x‖=1}{‖Ax‖}=\\sqrt{9}=3.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, the semi-major axis of our ellipse is $3.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-139530/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d116374b-b693-5d50-8019-fcc5a7766b9b"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-139530"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-139542/selection/9f6bfd6fa85d96298a99db901d9b73f609ef64ac0bcf5fbdc4a7ac6d3b733558" :answer/id #uuid "74dbd5ed-5fbb-5bd0-b0de-061dee28f5a9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-139542/selection/2edf353dc47d221855e5e7ee4be942392390ff01766e089c29dc368c2051b12d" :answer/id #uuid "cf27e955-daa2-5963-8445-2733ab3aa59b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-139542/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" :answer/id #uuid "f8fc340d-8bc9-5862-b7bd-f9a5d4eb6f46" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-139542/selection/713bb3b087b31554fba8b48520fba2f9d4d353e9b2d87f3d41c293daf48e1776" :answer/id #uuid "9e4c3f77-0571-5e06-abe3-c851feb5ab36" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "36" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-139542/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "80bf5c3b-5602-5112-8ea9-b9322798f630" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-139542/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "3c15ba5f-12a3-5e39-ad44-3d0de6d92224" :answer-field/key "selection"